  <item>
    <title>一场赤裸裸的心理自测报告会！人格风险大揭秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685b676c4abe6e29cbe360f2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685b676c4abe6e29cbe360f2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Jun 2025 03:33:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>👭 本期泡茶人：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>​寿司:​​ENFJ🗡️ 职场变色龙的“阴阳大师”日常</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​利好:​​INFP🦋 高分收割机！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>光头:ENFP🐶 如何驯服反社会冲动小野狗？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🔥 本期核心亮点：​</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><p><span>三位主播“以身试法”，拿出</span><strong><span>官方认证的CCMD-3人格风险评估报告</span></strong><span>，进行了一场史上最坦诚（且疯批）的自我解剖大会！12种潜在高危人格特质轮番登场：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>💥 震惊时刻：​</span></strong><span>​ 利好一人狂揽</span><strong><span>偏执型、分裂型、自恋型、边缘型、回避型</span></strong><span>多项超高危分数！最高</span><strong><span>97分</span></strong><span>现场封神？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>😂 社死现场：​</span></strong><span>​ 寿司揭露“被动攻击型人格”的生存法则——如何优雅地当个“高压锅”？阴阳怪气是最后的温柔？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>🕶️ 童年黑料：​</span></strong><span>​ 光头自曝反社会童年黑历史！“模仿老爹”的愤怒控制术？现场还原霸凌！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>💡 深度碰撞：​</span></strong><span>​ 当测试揭示的“人格风险”遭遇真实困境：    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span>职场“表演型人格”面具戴久了如何不崩溃？</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>原生家庭烙印 (打压式教育如何催生完美主义怪兽？童年经历如何塑造行为模式？)​</span></strong><span>​</span></li><span>      </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>自我和解还是持续发疯？​</span></strong><span>​ 在察觉与认命之间，他们如何寻找出路？</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🕒 高能时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>偏执型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>利好50分高危：把关心当控制？Fi功能过强的认知陷阱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>光头靠“对抗脑内小剧场”勉强压分</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>分裂样人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>全员中等分：社恐、怪癖、享受孤独的快乐</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>利好金句：</span><em><span>“我可能100分！毕竟人类太吵，独处才是刚需”</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>分裂型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>利好91.9分震惊全场：自我信仰+语言混乱[狗头]</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>光头神被调侃“x教教主潜质”：</span><em><span>“双生火焰教派等你开山！”</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>表演型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>全员50分：职场伪装者崩溃实录</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>光头：</span><em><span>“以前开会装激情，现在只想说‘别演了，老娘下班’！”</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>自恋型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>利好97分封神：“陶艺治好了我的完美主义——泥巴可不听指挥！”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>童年溯源：打压式教育如何催生完美主义怪兽</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>边缘型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>情绪过山车：上一秒阳光活力，下一秒自我粉碎</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>利好又得高分：迷人又危险的气息从何而来？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>反社会人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>光头自曝童年霸凌：</span><em><span>“模仿我爸用愤怒控制别人！”</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>当场控诉：寿司儿时惨遭利好霸凌（抢食</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>回避型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>利好接近满分：在人群中被看见就恐慌？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>寿司：</span><em><span>“超过10人的群聊，我立刻闭麦变表情包战士”</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>强迫型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>利好81分：秩序控的自我惩罚</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>寿司分享室友案例：军事化叠被+挤痘狂魔</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>被动攻击型</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>寿司：</span><em><span>“我像高压锅，阴阳怪气是唯一泄压阀”</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>破解指南：把“你猜我生不生气”</span><em><span>换成</span></em><span>“我现在需要…”</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>抑郁型人格</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>“我不够好”魔咒：自我攻击的深渊与救赎</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>​</span><strong><span>🔍 自测工具指南 ：​</span></strong><span>​</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>工具名称：CCMD-3人格风险评估</span></strong><span>​ (基于卫生部标准，武志红团队应用版本)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​</span><strong><span>特点：​</span></strong><span>​ 专业性强、覆盖14种潜在人格风险。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>​⚠️ 重要提示：​​报告只是“倾向性”提示，​</span><strong><span>并非诊断！​</span></strong><span>​</span><br><span>​</span><strong><span>90+题，通常仅限单次测评！​</span></strong><span>​</span><br><span>​</span><strong><span>主播忠告：分数 ≠ 标签！人格是流动的战场，察觉即是疗愈起点！​</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
